{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-foundations","title":"会计学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/accounting-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-equation","title":"大学会计学 — 会计恒等式与三大要素","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/accounting-foundations/accounting-equation","wordCount":1805,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"double-entry-bookkeeping","title":"大学会计学 — 复式记账与借贷记账法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/accounting-foundations/double-entry-bookkeeping","wordCount":1680,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"accounts-vouchers-ledgers","title":"大学会计学 — 会计科目、凭证与账簿","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/accounting-foundations/accounts-vouchers-ledgers","wordCount":1895,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 会计学基础\n\n本章建立会计的底层逻辑。你将先理解整个会计大厦赖以站立的\"会计恒等式\"，再掌握让账目永远平衡的\"复式记账\"机制，最后熟悉会计科目、会计凭证与账簿这套把交易变成报表的工业化流程。\n\n这三节内容是后续所有章节的地基。只要把\"资产 = 负债 + 所有者权益\"这一恒等式和\"有借必有贷、借贷必相等\"的记账规则真正内化为直觉，财务会计与报表分析就会变得水到渠成。\n"}